{"id":"n62519-1-7","stage":0,"title":"정류장 · 车站","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62519-1-7-1","ko":"거의 다 왔지?","zh":"快到站了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"거의","meaning":"几乎，快要","explanation":"거의：几乎，快要","readings":[{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60090","senseId":"2","lemma":"거의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔지?","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1b1da423b101b551","term":"거의","zh":"几乎，快要","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3","entryId":"60090","definition":"离某个状态或限度很近。","pronunciation":["거의","거이"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"动作或状态的程度似乎接近限定程度地。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c614451a690b22aab590.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62519-1-7-2","ko":"응. 다음 정류장에서 내리면 돼.","zh":"嗯，下一站下车就行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음","meaning":"下面，下一个","explanation":"다음：下面，下一个","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"1","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정류장에서","meaning":"车站","explanation":"정류장：车站；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"정류장","audio":"/audio/888da7692e098e28c0f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62519","senseId":"1","lemma":"정류장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내리면","meaning":"下，下去","explanation":"내리다：下，下去；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"4","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"下面，下一个","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"某个次序的后一个。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"888da7692e098e28","term":"정류장","zh":"车站","audio":"/audio/888da7692e098e28c0f2.mp3","entryId":"62519","definition":"为让人上下车，汽车或出租车等停车的地方。","pronunciation":["정뉴장"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下，下去","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"从乘坐的交通工具上出来而到某处。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3ed1f30bfbd8fbdc9262.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.3,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62519","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":19,"sequenceScore":0.9534,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["快到站了吧？